Package: CycloDesk
Type: Package
Title: Graphical Interface for Cyclostratigraphy with 'WaverideR' and 'astrochron'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Michiel", family = "Arts", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "michiel.arts@stratigraphy.eu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3181-4608"))
Description: Opens a point-and-click 'shiny' application for time-series analysis
    in cyclostratigraphy and paleoclimatology, inspired by the menu layout and
    working-folder workflow of 'Acycle' (Li et al. (2019) <doi:10.1016/j.cageo.2019.02.011>).
    All calculations are done by the R packages 'WaverideR' and 'astrochron':
    interpolation, detrending, spectral and evolutionary spectral analysis,
    wavelets and superlets, filtering, cycle tracking, astronomical solutions and
    insolation, floating and anchored age models and tuning, COCO/eCOCO and
    TimeOpt/eTimeOpt. Every operation writes its result as a text file next to
    the input and logs the equivalent R code, so an analysis made in the
    interface can be repeated in a script.
